>> a := Uhlu ← Into ; Iqiniso ; Amanga ; Ibhuliyeni ; 1 ; Inombolo ; ['Str'] ; Umbhalo ; { ['Empty']. }.
Okuphumayo bhala: (a inani), umugqa-omusha.
{ :i
	Okuphumayo bhala: 
	['a '] + 
	((a ? i) uhlobo) +
	([' \‘this\’ '] this: (a ? i))  +
	[' is '] +
	(((a ? i) Lutho?) lokhu: [''] noma-lokho: ['NOT']) + 
	[' Nil.'],
	umugqa-omusha.
} × (a inani).
Okuphumayo bhala: ['but.. Nil is.. '] + ((Lutho Lutho?) lokhu: ['certainly NIL!'] noma-lokho: ['not NIL??']), umugqa-omusha.